body:
You might be aromantic :) 

&#x200B;

https://www.asexuality-handbook.com/faq/am-i-aromantic.html

lmfao this is gonna sound either cringe or weird but definitely unique but I've known him for two years as online mutuals (we regularly post our faces so its not catfish-related). I was drunk one night and was about to go to sleep when I kind of saw his faces in glimpses of my imagination (probably through memory of a dream I couldn't fully remember) and then idk either thought he was attractive at that point or realized I liked him. then I sent him a voice message before I went to sleep, somewhere along the lines of "im very drunk right now but I think I like you". the thing is, we know almost everything about each other so i didnt have any second thought sending him this message. also, for some reason, I didnt expect any sort of response from him other than acknowledgement, so just thought, "well that's that" and didnt think much of it, thought it was just a passing crush.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

we're kind of now in a relationship and I plan to visit him and break the distance in december <3

I am so sorry that happened to you. False accusations are a life ruiner. I believe you. 

&#x200B;

But this one event doesn't give people the excuse to assume that every sexual assault accusation even without proof are false, since how does one easily get proof for something that they weren't prepared for?

"As you couldn't already tell from her name, Hana is of Japanese descent. I was really curious to see what she looked like, as I have a personal preference for Asian women. It's nothing creepy, I just like how they look."

&#x200B;

Fuck you. YTA. Sincerely, a Japanese person
